:"short","lore":"The Lumberjack Trainer has wool for a bowstring and an archer standing in his yard with twelve good pine logs.","state":"ready","giverId":"1cc14559-ba5d-47fa-8064-e134f7a15280","giverName":"Lumberjack Trainer","placeName":"Binxonia","position":{"x":-19,"y":-20,"z":0}},{"questId":"binxonia-ask-at-the-woodyard","name":"Ask at the Woodyard","category":"side","recommendedLevel":2,"lengthTag":"short","lore":"Ada Fen thinks you should learn a trade, and she knows who to ask.","state":"ready","giverId":"ada-fen","giverName":"Ada Fen","placeName":"Binxonia","position":{"x":35,"y":30,"z":0}},{"questId":"binxonia-quills-for-the-rounds","name":"Quills for the Rounds","category":"side","recommendedLevel":2,"lengthTag":"short","lore":"Ellis has worn his last quill down to a stump.","state":"ready","giverId":"ellis-pike","giverName":"Ellis Pike","placeName":"Binxonia","position":{"x":54,"y":13,"z":0}},{"questId":"binxonia-the-long-round","name":"The Long Round","category":"side","recommendedLevel":6,"lengthTag":"long","lore":"Ellis's route runs through the northern woods and back along the southwestern track. He wants someone to walk it before he risks a loaded cart.","state":"ready","giverId":"ellis-pike","giverName":"Ellis Pike","placeName":"Binxonia","position":{"x":54,"y":13,"z":0}},{"questId":"ogre-isle-unbearable","name":"Unbearable","category":"side","recommendedLevel":38,"lengthTag":"medium","lore":"Grumbo, a gentle ogre on the Ogre Isle beach, loved the island's bears. His kin hunted them to the last and smoked the meat, which is why ogres carry cooked bear in their belts.","state":"upcoming","lockedReason":"Requires level 37","giverId":"ogre-isle-grumbo","giverName":"Grumbo","placeName":"Ogre Isle Beach","position":{"x":301,"y":-135,"z":0}},{"questId":"plymouth-carpenters-trade","name":"The Carpenter's Trade","category":"skill","recommendedLevel":5,"lengthTag":"short","lore":"Hollis Tamber patches every boat that ties up at Plymouth Wharf, and he has more hulls than hours.","state":"ready","giverId":"plymouth-carpenter","giverName":"Hollis Tamber","placeName":"Plymouth Wharf","position":{"x":166,"y":-60,"z":0}},{"questId":"underleaf-standing-order-ogrewax","name":"Standing Order: Ogrewax","category":"daily","recommendedLevel":31,"lengthTag":"short","lore":"The Underleaf Tailor has a standing order for ogrewax, rendered from an ogre, every week without fail, and the Ogre Den has seventeen ogres nothing else points at.","state":"ready","giverId":"fa988c32-ee8c-4ee3-8d3b-a75bb81b46d6","giverName":"Tailor","placeName":"Underleaf","position":{"x":-50,"y":197,"z":-14},"surfaceWaypoint":{"x":-48.3,"y":200.6,"z":0}},{"questId":"wastelands-grit","name":"Grit","category":"side","recommendedLevel":36,"lengthTag":"long","lore":"The beasts in Hedda Crane's pen warn Ashreach of dragons, but the wind off the Dune Sea has filled with grit and they no longer settle.","state":"ready","giverId":"wl-ashreach-townsfolk-pen","giverName":"Hedda Crane","placeName":"Ashreach","position":{"x":1830.5,"y":66.5,"z":0}},{"questId":"wastelands-mhorsk","name":"Mhorsk","category":"side","recommendedLevel":39,"lengthTag":"long","lore":"Vanguard Captain Mhorsk holds the Thak camp on the Dune Sea and takes his orders from the fortress. Sergeant Ottilie Hallam wants those orders read at the Bloomguard Line.","state":"upcoming","lockedReason":"Requires level 38","giverId":"wl-ashreach-post-sergeant","giverName":"Sergeant Ottilie Hallam","placeName":"Dune Sea","position":{"x":1858,"y":120,"z":0}},{"questId":"wastelands-the-last-caravan","name":"The Last Caravan","category":"side","recommendedLevel":38,"lengthTag":"long","lore":"The caravans stopped coming to Ashreach. Tomas Reeve wants to know what happened to the last one, which a sandstorm buried at the west end of the Dune Sea.","state":"upcoming","lockedReason":"Requires level 37","giverId":"wl-ashreach-townsfolk-stall","giverName":"Tomas Reeve","placeName":"Ashreach","position":{"x":1842,"y":87,"z